# Early Bird Catches the Bookworm (windurst 20): Furakku-Norakku's Prog arms the main flow does not take. A GM's Prog -1
# meets no arm of his if / elseif chain (0, 1, >= 2): nil, his default 371. At Prog 2 (Orn's 398 never seen) he
# completes it, the `>= 2` boundary (the main flow completes from Prog 3): 1500 gil, fame +20, Savior of Knowledge, Art
# for Everyone gone, the player local var Quest[2][13]mustZone 1.
lists WindurstWaters/Furakku-Norakku/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/400
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-16.5,-5.25,102.0
quest Windurst.EarlyBirdCatchesTheBookworm accepted
charvar Quest[2][20]Prog -1
keyitem ArtForEveryone
login
trigger Furakku-Norakku             # Prog -1 (a GM's): nil; his default 371
finish
charvar Quest[2][20]Prog 2
trigger Furakku-Norakku             # Prog 2 (>= 2): 400
finish                              # completed: 1500 gil, fame +20, Savior of Knowledge; Art for Everyone gone; local var Quest[2][13]mustZone 1
trigger Furakku-Norakku             # completed, the local var set: 401 (replaceDefault)
finish
